        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-316089",
        "filing_date": "2026-07-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that the principal competitive factors in our licensees’ markets include price, performance, user-centric design, ease-of-use, quality, and timeliness of products, as well as the licensee’s responsiveness, capacity, technical abilities, established customer relationships, distribution channels and access to retail shelf space, advertising, promotional programs, and brand recognition.",
        "start_character": 17212,
        "end_character": 17609
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-316089",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-316089-e3d5e8e2ae834822",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-316089",
        "filing_date": "2026-07-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Additionally, we have licensed our patents to third party gaming peripheral manufacturers and distributors for use in spinning mass and force feedback devices such as controllers, steering wheels and joysticks, to be used with PC platforms running on Microsoft Windows and other operating systems, as well as in connection with video game consoles made by Microsoft, Sony, Nintendo and others.",
        "start_character": 14027,
        "end_character": 14420
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-316089",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-316089-e3d5e8e2ae834822",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-316089",
        "filing_date": "2026-07-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We expect that these internal design groups will continue to make choices regarding whether to implement haptics or not, as well as the extent of their haptic investment and whether to develop their own haptic solutions.",
        "start_character": 16669,
        "end_character": 16889
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-316089",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-316089-e3d5e8e2ae834822",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-316089",
        "filing_date": "2026-07-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We license our intellectual property relating to haptic technology to original equipment manufacturers (“OEMs”) in the mobile, gaming, and related consumer electronics markets.",
        "start_character": 13179,
        "end_character": 13355
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-316089",
